      <ul class="bullet">
        <li>Plasma p-tau217 + ML: AUC 0.96 for amyloid PET positivity (vs. 0.82 p-tau217 alone)</li>
        <li>Mass-spectrometry p-tau217 ratio: performance matches CSF in clinical AD staging (Hansson et al., <em>JAMA</em> 2023)</li>
        <li>AI-integrated multianalyte model: identifies Braak stage ≥IV with 89% accuracy</li>
      </ul>
      <span class="cite">Hansson et al., JAMA 2023; Palmqvist et al., JAMA 2024</span>
    </div>
