        <li>Plasma NfL: tracks neurodegeneration rate; predicts cognitive decline across all dementia types</li>
        <li>GFAP: astrocytic activation; strongly elevated in early AD; differentiates AD from FTD with AI integration</li>
        <li>Combined NfL+GFAP model: AUC 0.91 for identifying rapid progressors (Benedet et al., <em>Brain</em> 2021)</li>
      </ul>
      <span class="cite">Benedet et al., Brain 2021; Simrén et al., Lancet Neurol 2023</span>
