        <li>Longitudinal word usage change in published writings predicted AD onset 10+ yrs before diagnosis (Snowden et al., replication; De Santi et al.)</li>
        <li>Telephone speech analysis: 88% sensitivity for early MCI (Lam et al., <em>npj Digit Med</em> 2023)</li>
