        <li>LLM-based cognitive assessment tools: validated against MMSE/MoCA; high acceptance in older adults (Kaur et al., <em>npj Digit Med</em> 2024)</li>
        <li>Multimodal LLMs (text + audio): integrate acoustic + semantic features; AUC 0.92 DementiaBank benchmark</li>
        <li>Privacy-preserving federated LLM training across hospital networks without sharing raw data</li>
