      <ul class="bullet">
        <li><strong>SuStaIn algorithm</strong> (Young et al., <em>Nat Commun</em> 2018): unsupervised ML identifies disease subtypes from MRI/CSF trajectory data</li>
        <li>3 AD subtypes: typical, limbic-predominant, hippocampal-sparing — different rates of decline</li>
        <li>Bayesian event-based models estimate individual biomarker staging</li>
      </ul>
      <span class="cite">Young et al., Nat Commun 2018; Archetti et al., Nat Commun 2023</span>
